# Baked into the mobile bundle by `vite build --mode mobile` (build:mobile). Holds only
# the public API origin — no secrets — so it is committed, unlike .env/.env.local.
# Point this at the client-owned api. domain before any store release; installed apps
# keep whatever URL they were built with.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://burgers-bar-api-tj29.onrender.com
